# Domain glossary interview

When any `domain/packs/<slug>/pending.json` has items (or the user asks to resolve glossary pending):

1. Read each pending term (jp, lang, candidates, context).
2. Use Cursor's interview / AskQuestion UI to let the user pick the rendering (include candidates + custom).
3. Apply with:
   `npx tsx scripts/resolve-pending-glossary.ts --pack <slug> --choose <id>=<rendering>`
4. Do not ask the user to hand-edit `glossary.json`.

Confident post-job mines auto-write; only pending needs this interview.
